    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n11965" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπερυθριάω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>to put away blushes, to be past blushing,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Nu.</u>
				1216
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπερυθριᾷ πᾶς, ἐρυθριᾷ δ᾽ οὐδεὶς
					ἔτι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Men.
					782
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.547b
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Jud. Voc.</u>
				8
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Lib.
				<u>Decl.</u>
				15.43
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρὸς πάντας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Jul.
					<u>Or.</u>
					6.196d
				</span></i>
			. Adv.
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπηρυθριᾱκότως</span></b> ,
				<i>shamelessly,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Apollod.Com.
				13.10
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>cease to be red</i> or <i>flushed,</i>
